117
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:15,610
This is seen in some patients

118
00:07:15,610 --> 00:07:17,450
with rheumatic heart disease.

119
00:07:20,890 --> 00:07:24,430
Bicuspid aortic valve.
Congenital bicuspid

120
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:27,050
aortic valve represents
approximately 50

121
00:07:27,050 --> 00:07:31,090
% of cases of aortic
