127
00:07:50,290 --> 00:07:53,710
As you can see very well
on the left side drawing

128
00:07:53,710 --> 00:07:56,870
The most important
morphological anomaly in

129
00:07:56,870 --> 00:08:00,390
this condition is
represented by two conjointed

130
00:08:00,390 --> 00:08:04,650
cusps forming a larger
valve with a midline raffae

131
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:09,390
The raffi represents
